  notes: |
    Mobile split-pane layout — fixes the "BottomSheet blurs the editor
    and editor is unusable while sheet is open" complaint.

    (a) In-flow sheet. .app-body is now column flex on mobile;
        BottomSheet is a flex-child instead of position:fixed overlay.
        ScorePanel flex:1, sheet flex:0 0 var(--sheet-h, 50vh).
        Backdrop removed on mobile (was the source of the blur);
        body scroll unlocked.

    (b) Drag-handle. New wc-sheet__top-handle (cyan pill, 24px
        hit-area, cursor:ns-resize). Pointer drag in
        BottomSheet.onPointerMove updates setSheetHeightPx (clamp
        240..560px). Snap decisions on release: <240 → closed,
        >60vh → full, mid → half/peek. Persisted in localStorage
        wavecode-mobile-sheet-h-v1.

    (c) Internal sheet tabs. New SheetTabs component renders
        Mixer / AI / Status / Step / Piano inside the sheet header
        (hidden on desktop). Switches between tools without closing
        the sheet. setTab() is already single-active — Score tab in
        BottomNav closes everything (primary navigation back to
        editor full-height).

    (d) FAB shift. .wc-fab bottom: calc(tabbar-h + safe-bottom +
        sheet-h + space-md); 240ms spring transition. Sits above
        the sheet when open, below tabbar when closed.

    (e) ScorePanel max-height: calc(100dvh - header-h - tabbar-h -
        safe-bottom - sheet-h, 50vh), min-height: 200px. Readable
        even when sheet is full (70vh).

    (f) Layout refactor. BottomSheets moved from App.tsx
        sibling-of-body into PanelsLayout child-of-body (column
        flex parent). Desktop ≥1024px sheets.css @media override
        restores position:fixed right-side drawer.

    (g) Snap-points indicator (polish). 3-dot vertical column inside
        top-handle. The dot matching current data-snap-target (peek /
        half / full) lights up cyan + 1.5× scale. Live-updated during
        drag so the user sees where they'll snap BEFORE releasing.

    (h) Snap-feedback pill (polish). Cyan pill ('PEEK' / 'HALF' /
        'FULL') below the handle, role=status + aria-live=polite,
        visible only during drag. Pop animation 200ms spring.

    (i) Content-key fade (polish). sheet body data-content-key=
        '<snap>:<tab>'. CSS animation wc-sheet-fade 200ms keyed
        on the attribute — internal tab switching (Mixer → AI)
        cross-fades smoothly.

    Coverage: +11 uiState cases (sheetHeightPx clamps [240..560],
    localStorage round-trip, --sheet-h CSS var effect, fractional
    rounding, zero-clamp-to-min); +8 SheetTabs cases (5 tabs render,
    click delegation, active state). New e2e
    mobile-sheet-push.spec.ts (7 cases): split-pane layout,
    editor interactive while sheet open, internal tab switch,
    Score tab closes sheet, drag-handle resize, snap-points
    indicator (3 dots + live target), snap-feedback pill (shown
    only during drag).

    Verification: vitest 714/714 (52 files, +19 net new);
    tsc --noEmit clean; vite build succeeds. No new lint errors.

    Desktop regression: piano-rec-slot.spec.ts e2e continues to
    pass unchanged — sheets.css desktop override preserves the
    right-side drawer geometry. The desktop-affordance surface
    (right drawer, snap-transitions on drag) is intact.

